107h|n|A small fresh-water cyprinoid fish (Leuciscus idus or Idus idus) of Europe. A domesticated variety, colored like the goldfish, is called orfe in Germany.	n:1bbk,38,7;205w,31,3~1bbk,38,7;205w,31,3	N:b00,64,5~b00,64,5
